<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>6.4.6: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01633</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.4.6: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>1e2d5f2d-2b00-41b7-9bea-50b228f22ace</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para><emphasis><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></emphasis></para>
<para>For questions 1 – 3, find the GCF of each set of expressions.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(12m^2n^3, 30m^5n^3\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \(6m^3n^3\) </item>
      <item> \(3m^2n^3\) </item>
      <item> \(2m^5n^3\) </item>
      <item> \(6m^2n^3\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(6m^2n^3\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(28x^2y^4,42x^4y^4\)</item>
    </list>

<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis> \(14x^2y^4\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(27p^2q^3,45p^3q^4,9p^4q^3\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \(9pq^3\) </item>
      <item> \(27p^2q^3\) </item>
      <item> \(9p^2q^3\) </item>
      <item> \(9p^3q^3\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(9p^2q^3\)</para>
<para>For questions 4 – 6, factor the expression.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(15x^3y − 3x^2y^2 + 6xy^3\)</item>
    </list>

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(3xy(5x^2−xy+2y^2)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(−7a^3 + 21a^2 − 14a\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \(−7(a^2 − 3a + 2)\) </item>
      <item> \(7a(a^2 − 3a + 2)\) </item>
      <item> \(−7a^2(a − 1)\) </item>
      <item> \(−7a(a^2 − 3a + 2)\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(−7a(a^2 − 3a + 2)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(8n(n − 4) + 5(n − 4)\)</item>
    </list>


<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((n − 4)(8n + 5)\)</para>
<para>For questions 7 – 10, factor by grouping.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(u^2 − u + 6u − 6\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \((u + 1)(u + 6)\) </item>
      <item> \((u − 1)(u − 6)\) </item>
      <item> \((u + 1)(u − 6)\) </item>
      <item> \((u − 1)(u + 6)\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((u − 1)(u + 6)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(16q^2 + 20q − 28q − 35\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \((4q + 5)(4q + 7)\) </item>
      <item> \((4q − 5)(4q + 7)\) </item>
      <item> \((4q + 5)(4q − 7)\) </item>
      <item> \((4q − 5)(4q − 7)\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((4q + 5)(4q − 7)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(r^2 − 3r − r + 3\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \((r − 3)(r − 1)\) </item>
      <item> \((r + 3)(r + 1)\) </item>
      <item> \((r − 3)(r + 1)\) </item>
      <item> \((r + 3)(r − 1)\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((r − 3)(r − 1)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(6y^2 + 7y + 24y + 28\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \((6y + 7)(y + 4)\) </item>
      <item> \((y + 7)(6y + 4)\) </item>
      <item> \((6y − 7)(y − 4)\) </item>
      <item> \((y + 7)(6y − 4)\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((6y + 7)(y + 4)\)</para></section>
</content>
</document>
